  "consts": [
   "core/parsers/import_po.py - TJX-style Import PO fixed-column item table.\n\nLayout (TJX Companies Inc. / GS GLOBAL SOURCING Import PO):\n\n    PG/LN CATG LOCAL COST VENDOR STYLE COLOR DETAILED DESCRIPTION UNITS SETS BOX\n    1/1 0502 6 9.40 AW35628 Micro Chip Mock Neck Corded Jacket S 50 N N K\n\nThe text layer merges the ``VENDOR STYLE`` and ``COLOR`` columns, producing a\ncontinuous token stream ``AW35628 Micro Chip Mock Neck Corded Jacket ...``. We\ntreat the first token as the style number (``AW35628``) and the leading words\nbefore the garment stopwords as the human-readable colour (``Micro Chip``).\nOne row per (style, colour, size); the size is a single token (S/M/L/XL or a\nwaist number) and UNITS is the line quantity. A second ``PAGE/LINE VENDOR COLOR\nDETAILED DESCRIPTION SIZE ...`` summary table repeats the same items and is ignored\n(the first table is authoritative and complete).\n\nEntities are split by ``consolidate_entities_by_style_dest`` on\n``(po_no, style_no, destination_code)``, so a single PO with two vendor styles\nbecomes two entities (e.g. ``AW35628``/``Micro Chip`` and ``AW35372``/``Sea Spray``).\n",
